<title>PHILIPPINES: PNCC signs contract with Malaysian firm. [CORRECTED 03:43 GMT]</title>
<headline>PNCC signs contract with Malaysian firm. [CORRECTED 03:43 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine National Construction Corp (PNCC) said on Thursday (corrects from Tuesday) it had signed an agreement under which Malaysia's TA Properties Sdn Bhd will build a high-rise mixed-used complex.</p>
<p>The complex will be built on a PNCC-owned 23,218 sq metre site along EDSA, Manila's main north-south road, PNCC said in a statement.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
